Your affinity for the shadows grow stronger.

Whenever one of your spells deal darkness damage you have a 20% chance to gain 8% to all damage affinity for 8 turns.

If you kill a creature with darkness damage this effect always triggers.

You can only gain one stack of Dark Reign per turn.

This effect stacks multiplicatively up to [1, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] times.
